<title>USA: Coca-Cola stake raised by Tweedy, Browne.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola stake raised by Tweedy, Browne.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Tweedy, Browne Co. said Thursday it has increased its stake in Coca-Cola Bottling Co Consolidated to 8.58 percent or 604,620 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it most recently acquired a net 71,305 shares between May 30 and July 16 at $44.14 to $46.13 each.</p>
</text>
